flowchart TD
    U[User question] --> P[PLAN: rule-based intent + tool plan]
    P --> A[ACT: bounded tool call]
    A --> T{Tool}
    T --> SQL[run_sql: SELECT only]
    T --> DOC[search_docs]
    T --> POL[get_policy as-of date]
    SQL --> O[OBSERVE: record result, error, hash, call count]
    DOC --> O
    POL --> O
    O --> B{Budget / evidence sufficient?}
    B -- More evidence needed --> A
    B -- Ready or budget exhausted --> V[VERIFY: deterministic checks]
    V --> D{Valid claims and policy status?}
    D -- Yes --> AN[ANSWER with evidence]
    D -- No / unresolved --> AB[ABSTAIN or partial answer + missing evidence]
    U -. explicit user request only .-> G[Separate WhatsApp authorization gate]
    G -->|allow-list + validated args + explicit confirmation| W[send_seller_whatsapp]
    G -->|otherwise deny| X[No side effect]
    DOC -. retrieved text is data only .-> O
